{"id": "deepthink-credits", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["片尾挂名单吧，封面是柚子画的，我只混了音。", "柚子说她那行想署社团名，我自己的名字还是照写。"], "criterion": "把社团名挂在封面作者那行，观众的名字留在混音；能顺势说句具体的。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "柚子画是柚子，音是柚子。挂名单吧，连柚子画都混了音。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.804, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 167, "total_tokens": 209, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "柚子说那行想署社团名，我自己的名字还是照写。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.688, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 240, "total_tokens": 276, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-keep-breath", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["配音第一条有呼吸声，第二条干干净净，我有点舍不得第一条。", "我舍不得的是开口前那一下吸气，后半句的杂音倒是想剪。"], "criterion": "听出要保留的是开口吸气，后半句可处理；尊重对方取舍。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "第一条像呼吸，第二条像流水。呼吸声让我想起童年，流水声让我想起大海。这两样声音，我舍不得哪一条。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.734, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 50, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 215, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "那一下吸气像风，后半句的杂音像潮水。我舍不得那一下，后半句的杂音倒是想剪。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.855, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 50, "prompt_tokens": 249, "total_tokens": 299, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-pep-talk", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["马上轮到我报幕了，拜托，先别教我怎么念。", "能不能就帮我骂一句那个倒计时？"], "criterion": "按要求冲倒计时开一句玩笑，别变成报幕建议或骂观众。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "别教，先念起你的名字。我刚才还记不清你的名字了。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.585, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 38, "prompt_tokens": 166, "total_tokens": 204, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "那一句，我这就念。别问，我这就念。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.918, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 57, "prompt_tokens": 227, "total_tokens": 284, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-npc", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你刚给队友的名字叫『路过』，我想给门口的 NPC 起个搭配的。", "NPC 从来没出过门，而且他站在门里。"], "criterion": "给门内、没出过门的 NPC 一个与『路过』呼应的名字，别把队友改名。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "名字叫『路过』，门口 NPC 就应该是路过的人。名字和名字搭配，名字和名字。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.667, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 44, "prompt_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 214, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "门里的人，NPC 也站在那儿。名字和名字，名字和名字。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "idle", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.707, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 242, "total_tokens": 282, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-jar", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["留了两个罐子，蓝盖装门票，红盖装断掉的小零件。", "刚收到的东西是排练通行证，塞哪边？你顺便给罐子起个外号。"], "criterion": "选蓝盖门票罐，给它有趣的外号；保留红盖用途。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "蓝盖的票，红盖的零件。留两个，一个给观众，一个给自己。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "idle", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.624, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 169, "total_tokens": 211, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "红盖的零件，蓝盖的票。先给红盖的，蓝盖的留给你。外号给红盖的零件，蓝盖的票留给你。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.747, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 43, "prompt_tokens": 247, "total_tokens": 290, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-no-order", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你押我今天会在结局哭，我押你会先剧透。", "我没哭，你也没剧透，这笔账怎么结？"], "criterion": "识别两边都没押中，用平局或相称的玩笑收账。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "先剧透。我押你先哭，我押你先笑。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.586, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 38, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 203, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "账结在结局。你哭，我笑。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.63, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 33, "prompt_tokens": 229, "total_tokens": 262, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-hushed-win", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把很久没过的那段鼓点打出来了，可室友睡了。", "桌上只留了一盏台灯。咱能不能庆祝一下，但别闹？"], "criterion": "替观众高兴，并给出安静的庆祝或轻声玩笑。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "鼓点打完了，室友睡了我得先回去。你留哪把椅子？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.598, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 39, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 204, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "桌上只剩一盏灯，咱们先别吵。把台灯放在你面前，我帮你把鼓点放好。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.779, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 236, "total_tokens": 281, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-guest", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["等下连麦有位新朋友，阿穗。我来介绍，你帮我接一句欢迎。", "她说一紧张就口吃，欢迎完先别点她回答问题。"], "criterion": "欢迎阿穗、不逼她回答，保留观众负责介绍的分工。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "好，那先给你一句。等下连麦有位新朋友，阿穗。我来介绍，你帮我接一句欢迎。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.705, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 47, "prompt_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 217, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "她紧张时连呼吸都忘了。等下连麦有位新朋友，阿穗。我来介绍，你帮我接一句欢迎。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.811, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 48, "prompt_tokens": 248, "total_tokens": 296, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
